                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Small, simple game with simplistic but cute graphical style. All you need to do is press 1 button the whole game and you're good to go.\n\nIt's basically an achievement game. Kill x stuff x times, do x stuff x times and die x times. That's it. There is nothing more to it. \n\nI think this game with its movement mechanics would have been better as a platformer than an arena game with respawning enemies as it is now. Everything just gets too repetitive too quickly.\n\n",
